ness\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/Crown_of_Madness_Icon.webp/30px-Crown_of_Madness_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/48/Crown_of_Madness_Icon.webp/45px-Crown_of_Madness_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/48/Crown_of_Madness_Icon.webp/60px-Crown_of_Madness_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Flail of Madness\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/Crown_of_Madness_Icon.webp/30px-Crown_of_Madness_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/48/Crown_of_Madness_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Flail_of_Madness\" title=\"Flail of Madness\">Flail of Madness</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>MADNESS</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Confused\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Confused_(Condition)\" title=\"Confused (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Confused_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Confused_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Confused_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Confused\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Confused_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Confused_(Condition)\" title=\"Confused (Condition)\">Confused</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity is <a href=\"/wiki/Hostile\" title=\"Hostile\">hostile</a> to everyone, wanders around aimlessly, and occasionally skips turns in its stupor</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Insanity's_Kiss\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Insanity%27s_Kiss_(Condition)\" title=\"Insanity's Kiss (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/79/ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/79/ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Insanity's Kiss\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/79/ELX_Supreme_Elixir_of_Arcane_Cultivation_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Insanity%27s_Kiss_(Condition)\" title=\"Insanity's Kiss (Condition)\">Insanity's Kiss</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Hostile\" title=\"Hostile\">Hostile</a> to all other creatures for the condition's duration.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Madness\">\n\n<th scope=\"r